                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2e1bbf0c-b548-3218-8395-2848ce8940db",
                        "entry_id": "f3f70a9f-4ad3-389a-992e-3b9d6e6e03ff",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Leningrad (the name of a major city in Russian SFSR, from 1924 to 1991)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "historical"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5fbbd209-3e19-4424-a886-73397bdd1977",
                                "sense_id": "2e1bbf0c-b548-3218-8395-2848ce8940db",
                                "text": "Установи́ть на 5 дней план перево́зки в Ленингра́д продово́льствия в коли́честве не ме́нее 200 тонн в день сле́дующих проду́ктов: 135 тонн концентра́тов – ка́ша пшённая и суп горо́ховый; 20 тонн колбасы́ копчёной и свини́ны копчёной; 10 тонн сухо́го молока́ и яи́чного порошка́; 15 тонн ма́сла сли́вочного; 20 тонн комбижи́ра и са́ла топлёного.",
                                "translation": "To establish for 5 days a plan for the transportation of foodstuffs to Leningrad in an amount of at least 200 tons per day of the following products: 135 tons of concentrates – millet porridge and pea soup; 20 tons of smoked sausage and smoked pork; 10 tons of powdered milk and powdered eggs; 15 tons of butter; 20 tons of mixed fats and ghee lard.",
                                "english": "To establish for 5 days a plan for the transportation of foodstuffs to Leningrad in an amount of at least 200 tons per day of the following products: 135 tons of concentrates – millet porridge and pea soup; 20 tons of smoked sausage and smoked pork; 10 tons of powdered milk and powdered eggs; 15 tons of butter; 20 tons of mixed fats and ghee lard."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
